        <https://www.sbco.or.jp/ont/SubstanceEnum#IrrigationWater>,
        <https://www.sbco.or.jp/ont/SubstanceEnum#Light>,
        <https://www.sbco.or.jp/ont/SubstanceEnum#MakeupWater>,
        <https://www.sbco.or.jp/ont/SubstanceEnum#NaturalGas>,
        <https://www.sbco.or.jp/ont/SubstanceEnum#NonPotableDomesticWater>,
